70 |      * <ol>
71 |      *   <li>Mark review ANALYZING (progress 10 %)</li>
72 |      *   <li>Delete any existing findings for this review (idempotent re-run)</li>
73 |      *   <li>Run the static-analysis engine against the stored diff</li>
74 |      *   <li>Persist findings, mark COMPLETED (progress 100 %)</li>
75 |      *   <li>Emit REVIEW_COMPLETED and NEW_FINDINGS notifications</li>
