16 | /**
17 |  * ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
18 |  * │  MOCK ANALYSIS ENGINE — NOT ACTUAL AI                                    │
19 |  * │                                                                          │
20 |  * │  This service simulates an AI code-review by pattern-matching the        │
21 |  * │  submitted codeDiff and returning deterministic sample findings.         │
22 |  * │                                                                          │
23 |  * │  It is intentionally labelled MOCK throughout the codebase.             │
24 |  * │  A real IBM Granite / watsonx analysis engine will replace this in      │
