/**
 * ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 * │  MOCK ANALYSIS ENGINE — NOT ACTUAL AI                                    │
 * │                                                                          │
 * │  This service simulates an AI code-review by pattern-matching the        │
 * │  submitted codeDiff and returning deterministic sample findings.         │
 * │                                                                          │
 * │  It is intentionally labelled MOCK throughout the codebase.             │
 * │  A real IBM Granite / watsonx analysis engine will replace this in      │
 * │  a future task once the IBM Bob integration is complete.                │
 * └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
 *
 * The method runs asynchronously so that POST /reviews returns immediately
 * while analysis proceeds in the background.
