     * <ul>
     *   <li>Hardcoded credentials / secrets in added lines</li>
     *   <li>SQL string concatenation (injection risk)</li>
     *   <li>TODO / FIXME comments left in added lines</li>
     *   <li>Catch blocks that swallow exceptions silently</li>
     *   <li>Missing null-check patterns (e.g. .get() without isPresent)</li>
     *   <li>Generic "code quality" note on large diffs</li>
     * </ul>
     *
     * <p>If the diff is blank, one informational finding is added noting that
     * there was nothing to analyse.
     */
